Author: Immortal / Divine
Version: 3.1
Requires: PowerShell 5.1+, .NET Framework 4.6.2+, Administrator privileges, Bypassed 32-bit PowerShell execution.

[Changelogs]
   - Added:

	- Increase the speed of launch and login dramatically.
	- Launch and login can now handle multiple clients at the same time. (Multi-Launch will be available with the next Entropia Patch)
	- New Max Total Clients option caps new clients per launch; blank or 0 means unlimited.
	- Settings -> Launch is split into Saved Setups and Launch Options, with Max Clients moved there.

   - Fixed:

	- Logins only restore minimized windows instead of forcing every client to the foreground.
	- A finished login no longer tears down the runspace and timers the other logins are still using.
	- Launch safety and progress timers are created once and reused instead of stacking up.
	- Shutdown stops and disposes every running login job, not just the last one.
	- Launch starts the rest of the clients straight from neuz.exe once one client is already running.



